      "bottomRightY": 219,
      "content": "$$\\left. \\begin{array}{l} a^2 + b^2 + 2abS = 1, \\\\ c^2 + d^2 + 2cdS = 1, \\\\ ac + bd + (ad + bc)S = 0 \\end{array} \\right\\} \\quad (5)$$",
